                        "language": "english",
                        "review": "Loved this with a friend 10+ years ago, building castles and siege gear that actually obeyed physics. But Keen ended development in 2020 and walked away to focus on Space Engineers, so what you buy today is an unfinished Early Access game with a “release” label on it. Great memories, but not suggested, look elsewhere all!",
